Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.08,0:01:35.26,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,It's morning. I've got to eat something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.76,0:01:39.12,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,SCRAWNY
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.06,0:01:39.12,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.07,0:01:42.87,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Looks like he's lost weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.22,0:01:46.89,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Yeah, Lize doesn't like \Nto eat a whole lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.13,0:01:52.63,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,He even pretended to be sick before.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.69,0:01:57.01,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,I CANNOT EAT...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.04,0:01:56.44,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,But Luna saw right through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.24,0:01:59.97,Default,Merino,0,0,0,,I wonder if he just doesn't \Nlike Luna's cooking.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.01,0:02:04.06,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,I'll be back later!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.28,0:02:05.58,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,HE WAS ALLOWED TIME TO\N PICK WILD STRAWBERRIES
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.66,0:02:13.04,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,EPISODE 8: WHITE WITCHES \NAND BLACK WITCHES
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.02,0:02:11.02,Default,Merino/Minos,0,0,0,,Did Lize really say \Nhe hates your cooking?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.24,0:02:16.03,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Well, he is royalty, after all. \NHe's probably a really picky eater.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.53,0:02:23.15,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,But is it really inedible? Twist his arm\N if you have to, just make him eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.94,0:02:31.32,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Us black witches don't have \Nto eat like humans do anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.32,0:02:34.00,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,so we don't really get how that works.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.44,0:02:41.14,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Mushroom Lord, thank you for seeing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.46,0:02:45.51,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Now that I think about it, I once \Nheard that natural energy eaters
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.76,0:02:48.94,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,taste things differently than humans do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.79,0:02:50.52,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,HAVING NOTICED LUNA AND THE OTHERS WERE\N ACTING STRANGE, LIZE MADE PLANS TO SPEAK \NSECRETLY TO THE CHATTY MUSHROOM AGAIN.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.94,0:02:51.07,Default,Merino/Minos,0,0,0,,What? They do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.07,0:02:53.52,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Natural energy eaters?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.52,0:02:56.38,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,We can get by with natural energy alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.38,0:02:59.22,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,but since he's closer to human and \Nhas a white witch's constitution,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.22,0:03:00.85,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,it isn't that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.85,0:03:05.43,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Mushroom Lord, what does \N"natural energy eater" mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.04,0:03:07.69,Default,Chatty Mushroom,0,0,0,,Well, let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.69,0:03:13.19,Default,Chatty Mushroom,0,0,0,,Black witches like Luna do not get \Ntheir sustenance by eating food,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.19,0:03:18.55,Default,Chatty Mushroom,0,0,0,,but by extracting the magic and life \Nforce directly from nature itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.93,0:03:21.69,Default,Chatty Mushroom,0,0,0,,Black witches, with their strong magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.69,0:03:26.00,Default,Chatty Mushroom,0,0,0,,always have fresh energy \Nflowing through their bodies,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.00,0:03:29.06,Default,Chatty Mushroom,0,0,0,,so they do not age the way that humans do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.67,0:03:35.43,Default,Chatty Mushroom,0,0,0,,They never had any need for the kind of \Nculinary traditions humans developed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.85,0:03:41.46,Default,Chatty Mushroom,0,0,0,,However, Luna is very interested \Nin human culture and customs,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.46,0:03:45.30,Default,Chatty Mushroom,0,0,0,,so perhaps she was trying to \Ncopy what she knew of cooking.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.66,0:03:50.33,Default,Chatty Mushroom,0,0,0,,Perhaps she wanted a taste of what it \Nis like to be part of the human world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.17,0:03:56.75,Default,Chatty Mushroom,0,0,0,,However, it seems observations and books \Nalone were not enough to teach her
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.75,0:03:58.98,Default,Chatty Mushroom,0,0,0,,how something should taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.98,0:04:00.61,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Poor Miss Witch...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.29,0:04:05.39,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,You remember that time you said \Nyou baked a really nice cake
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.39,0:04:08.01,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,and decided to send it to \Nanother magician as thanks?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.77,0:04:13.30,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Oh, that cake! It was really yummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.65,0:04:17.16,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,It was for Master Bird and \NI'm the one who took it to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.16,0:04:18.82,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,He took a bite and said...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.82,0:04:23.32,Flashback,Bird Magician,0,0,0,,Is this a kind of experimental \Ndrug or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.73,0:04:30.08,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Yeah, so you might wanna get \Na human friend to taste your cooking
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.08,0:04:32.42,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,and get some pointers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.83,0:04:37.99,Default,Gilles,0,0,0,,Is this some kind of pie-shaped medicine?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.33,0:04:45.34,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,APOTHECARY
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.99,0:04:44.13,Default,Gilles,0,0,0,,Honestly, I think the usual pills or \Nliquids are a lot easier to ingest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.34,0:04:52.85,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,THE MOUSE MAGICIAN
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.82,0:04:48.86,Default,Mouse Magician,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.86,0:04:51.33,Default,Mouse Magician,0,0,0,,Yeah, this tastes nothing \Nlike food. Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.85,0:04:55.99,Default,Lancelot,0,0,0,,Even pigs wouldn't eat this sort of slop.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.35,0:05:00.36,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,THE PIG PRINCE, LANCELOT
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.60,0:04:58.77,Default,Lancelot,0,0,0,,Maybe it'll work for cow feed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.03,0:05:04.61,Default,Bookseller,0,0,0,,Oh. I don't need to eat any.\N I can sense the aura.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.61,0:05:07.61,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,THREAT DETECTION
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.61,0:05:07.61,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,BOOKSELLER
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.61,0:05:07.61,Default,Bookseller,0,0,0,,But here's a cookbook \NI think you should read.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.06,0:05:13.89,Default,Bookseller,0,0,0,,Oh, that's why. There's a human child \Nthat you're trying to cook for.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.25,0:05:16.87,Default,Bookseller,0,0,0,,Are you using good ingredients?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.10,0:05:20.88,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,If I can't get something, \NI leave it out or use a substitute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.88,0:05:25.66,Default,Bookseller,0,0,0,,If that's all you're doing, it still\N shouldn't turn out this bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.66,0:05:27.63,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Don't sweat it, Luna.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.39,0:05:32.14,Default,Bookseller,0,0,0,,Can you think of any \Nother reason for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.14,0:05:35.81,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,I use reversal magic to remove \Nthe poison from the mushrooms,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.81,0:05:40.85,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,and sometimes cheat with magic to \Nmake it look more like the real thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.85,0:05:42.15,Default,Bookseller,0,0,0,,That explains it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.34,0:05:49.25,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.25,0:05:50.66,Default,Cheese Shop Owner,0,0,0,,Hey, step on up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.66,0:05:52.39,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,I'd like one wheel of cheese and—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.39,0:05:56.15,Default,Cheese Shop Owner,0,0,0,,Yikes! It's the poison mushroom \Nwitch everyone's talking about!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.15,0:06:01.67,Default,Cheese Shop Owner,0,0,0,,Sorry, but would you get away? Please \Ndon't grow any mushrooms on my product!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.67,0:06:04.10,Default,Greengrocer,0,0,0,,Ah! Get away from my shop!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.10,0:06:07.51,Default,Greengrocer,0,0,0,,What're ya gonna do \Nif you spoil all my goods?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.18,0:06:12.61,Default,Person in Market,0,0,0,,Stay away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.61,0:06:15.06,Default,Person in Market,0,0,0,,Hurry up and get out of our town!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.43,0:06:31.20,Default,Farmer,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.20,0:06:34.18,Default,Farmer,0,0,0,,What's this? You want us \Nto sell you vegetables?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.43,0:06:40.26,Default,Farmer,0,0,0,,That puts us in a real spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.26,0:06:43.98,Default,Farmer,0,0,0,,You're that poison witch from \Nthe black forest, aren't ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.18,0:06:52.72,Default,Rancher,0,0,0,,If folks found out I sold ya all \Nthat milk, I'd be in real hot water.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.03,0:06:57.25,Default,Rancher,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I gotta charge ya \Ndouble market price or no deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.47,0:07:04.87,Default,Farmer 2,0,0,0,,Well, let's see. I guess I could sell \Nsome for three times market price.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.43,0:07:21.54,Default,Chatty Mushroom,0,0,0,,My boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.95,0:07:23.02,Default,Chatty Mushroom,0,0,0,,My boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.50,0:07:27.29,Default,Chatty Mushroom,0,0,0,,Your sadness is turning into \Nblight and starting to overflow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.51,0:07:33.51,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Do I really have to write about \Nthis feeling in my diary?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.11,0:07:37.99,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,If I write it down, \Nit'll be like I never felt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.99,0:07:43.41,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,I'll go back to not knowing anything \Nabout how Miss Witch feels.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.72,0:07:49.46,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,I know the blight I collect creates \Na lot of problems for everyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.90,0:07:53.03,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,but the thought of living on \Nwith no memory of her pain
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.01,0:07:56.41,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,scares me even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.85,0:08:00.89,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Is there any way I can \Nhang on to this feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.29,0:08:04.29,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,As far as I'm concerned, \Neven if I'm corrupted,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.01,0:08:08.69,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,this pain is a very valuable, \Neven irreplaceable feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.55,0:08:12.38,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Even if they say this \Nfeeling is poisonous,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.45,0:08:16.55,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,I don't want to let go of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.83,0:08:20.71,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Luna, Lize just got home!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.06,0:08:22.54,Default,Merino,0,0,0,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.54,0:08:25.31,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Did you pick a bunch of \Nraspberries and stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.33,0:08:28.67,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Well, no, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.08,0:08:31.89,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Wow, you're such a goof, Lize.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.89,0:08:36.54,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,You can't do anything without me, can you?\N Next time I'll go with and help.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.54,0:08:39.72,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Dinner is ready. Take a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.73,0:08:47.89,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.34,0:08:49.94,Default,Merino,0,0,0,,It smells good!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.94,0:08:51.34,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,It looks good!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.34,0:08:55.09,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,It's a turnip and milk soup. With bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.09,0:08:57.59,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Um, I didn't make much, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.59,0:08:58.82,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.58,0:09:03.10,Default,All,0,0,0,,Thank you for the food!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.10,0:09:10.61,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,This is good!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.61,0:09:18.20,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Hey Lize, I'm the one who found \Nthe guy selling this milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.20,0:09:20.63,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,And I baked the bread by myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.63,0:09:21.96,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,You're kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.96,0:09:23.91,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Yep, I'm kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.91,0:09:27.17,Flashback_Italics,Chatty Mushroom,0,0,0,,My boy, you must deepen your understanding
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.17,0:09:30.50,Flashback_Italics,Chatty Mushroom,0,0,0,,and open your heart as wide as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.50,0:09:35.01,Flashback_Italics,Chatty Mushroom,0,0,0,,That is to say, you must \Nexperience so much cheer and joy
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.01,0:09:38.07,Flashback_Italics,Chatty Mushroom,0,0,0,,that it smothers out \Nthe darkness you carry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.51,0:09:44.73,Flashback_Italics,Chatty Mushroom,0,0,0,,But in order to find that happiness, \Nyou must look to your own heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.10,0:09:49.25,Flashback_Italics,Chatty Mushroom,0,0,0,,So, my boy, seek out \Nas much joy as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.74,0:09:55.24,Flashback_Italics,Chatty Mushroom,0,0,0,,If you do, even the mighty blight \Nwill eventually up and run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.50,0:10:05.25,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,That day, with my heart and my belly \Nboth full, I didn't write in my diary.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.41,0:10:12.46,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,The next day, I asked Miss Witch and the \NMushroom Lord about building a garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.46,0:10:16.97,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Miss Witch told me that I have a natural \Ntalent for growing vegetables,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.97,0:10:22.72,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,and went into town to find \Nme a book about gardening.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.94,0:10:25.81,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,She said she'd let me study gardening,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.81,0:10:28.45,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,as long as I don't neglect \Nmy magic training.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.45,0:10:30.73,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I really started to love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.19,0:10:35.77,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,When I was studying, the little things \Nthat bothered me would just float away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.97,0:10:40.95,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I imagined days of plowing, \Ndays of watching plants sprout,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.95,0:10:45.12,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,days of thanking the sun \Nand the earth and the rain,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.12,0:10:48.88,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,days of watching my plants \Ngrow, and days of harvesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.88,0:10:55.47,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Whenever I imagine the days to come, \Nmy heart fills right up with joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.51,0:11:00.19,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Okay, do it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.67,0:11:01.64,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.88,0:11:10.13,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Don't get distracted, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.14,0:11:12.60,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.60,0:11:17.70,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Jeez. You got some nerve slacking off \Nwhen you already can't learn worth crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.33,0:11:27.37,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I've noticed myself thinking about \NMiss Witch a whole lot recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.03,0:11:32.37,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,But not about her being a poison \Nwitch. About how beautiful she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.93,0:11:37.86,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I wonder why. It feels \Nlike every cell inside me,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.86,0:11:40.88,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,from the hair on my head to \Nthe tips of my toes, is drawn to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.88,0:11:44.85,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Are you even listening to me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.85,0:11:46.89,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I've got to concentrate on my training.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.89,0:11:52.39,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,CAW! GYAH! SQUAWK! GRR! CAW!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.89,0:11:48.53,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,This isn't good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.53,0:11:52.08,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,And I get punished with close-ups \Nof the ugliest thing in this world,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.08,0:11:54.38,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,the crow's twisted face.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.40,0:11:51.08,Italics - Top,BGM,0,0,0,,Emotional abuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.85,0:11:54.68,Italics - Top,BGM,0,0,0,,Emotional abuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.68,0:11:55.80,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I've got to do better!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.68,0:11:57.90,Italics - Top,BGM,0,0,0,,Emotional abuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.68,0:11:57.90,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.14,0:12:01.57,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,The crow says he's observing Lize,\N but it's always an excuse to bully him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.14,0:12:05.41,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,I'm not bullying him! This is training!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.14,0:12:11.30,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Reversal magic, time magic, \Nspatial magic, transformation magic...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.56,0:12:09.50,Italics - Top,BGM,0,0,0,,Emotional abuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.30,0:12:13.17,Italics - Top,BGM,0,0,0,,Emotional abuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.30,0:12:14.42,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,There's a ton of magic that \NI'm supposed to learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.42,0:12:16.42,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Next is the apple. Give it a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.85,0:12:16.42,Italics - Top,BGM,0,0,0,,Emotional abuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.09,0:12:20.17,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,The one I'm practicing \Nnow is conjuring magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.91,0:12:26.63,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,You use one thing from your body to \Nconjure something else that exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.89,0:12:32.93,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,You can only get one measly \Nleaf out of a tuft of hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.93,0:12:37.17,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,At this rate, you'll end up totally bald\N before you conjure a single apple.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.17,0:12:38.58,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Caw, caw, caw!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.44,0:12:42.12,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,No matter how hard I try,\N the only thing I'm getting better at
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.12,0:12:44.45,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,is blocking out whatever \Nthe crow says to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.45,0:12:47.90,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Hey, Luna. Show him how it's done again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.63,0:12:59.19,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,For more skilled magicians, even \None hair... no, even one drop of sweat,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.19,0:13:01.95,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,should be enough to produce \Nsomething that wasn't there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.71,0:13:06.73,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Luna got the hang of this \Nmagic in no time, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.72,0:13:09.72,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,IN NO TIME
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.98,0:13:12.28,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I'm starting to realize that \NI might be a complete failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.28,0:13:16.83,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,B-But the apples I make, you know,\N probably taste really bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.83,0:13:21.14,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I guess that's reassuring, but I'm \Nnot sure how to respond to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.02,0:13:23.26,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,You can have this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.57,0:13:26.09,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,You're giving him a gross apple?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.09,0:13:27.74,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,I-It shouldn't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.07,0:13:29.74,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Don't do that, Luna.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.97,0:13:32.74,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,B-But it's not... probably not...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.74,0:13:38.75,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I still don't know what my purpose is \Nin life. I don't know a lot of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.58,0:13:40.94,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.94,0:13:43.81,Default - Top,Merino,0,0,0,,Wow, that's great, Lize!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.97,0:13:44.76,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,But I want to live up to \NMiss Witch's expectations.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.76,0:13:50.39,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,With that as my guiding light, \NI think I can endure the hard training.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.69,0:13:53.77,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,You gotta quit spoiling him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.27,0:14:03.28,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,The council members will show up soon \Nto test him. Could be any day now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.45,0:14:07.06,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,So what magic has he learned so far?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.38,0:14:09.78,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,H-How to use his diary.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.18,0:14:11.93,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,That doesn't even count!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.83,0:14:16.17,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Gravity, healing, and conjuring magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.17,0:14:18.29,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Yeah, but all only barely.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.01,0:14:22.49,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,And that's it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.49,0:14:28.17,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,The Mushroom Lord said that Lize \Ncan grow plants real fast, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.17,0:14:29.80,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Something about a green—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.90,0:14:31.69,Default - Top,Claude,0,0,0,,Drop it, bull. Keep that to yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.81,0:14:38.31,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Something I've realized since \NI started the garden
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.17,0:14:44.22,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,is that even though I don't have seeds, \NI can make the plants I imagine sprout up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.22,0:14:47.77,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,That is not easy to do for most people.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.32,0:14:53.05,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,That's what Miss Witch said, but \Neveryone acts kind of uncomfortable
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.05,0:14:55.75,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,about this power I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.41,0:14:58.65,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.18,0:15:02.85,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Lize, eat as much as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.85,0:15:04.92,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,And become a big boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.92,0:15:08.84,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Picky wittle boys don't \Ngwow up big and stwong.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.93,0:15:13.75,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Hmm? What's he so gloomy about?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.17,0:15:15.49,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Dunno.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.39,0:15:18.43,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.92,0:15:23.44,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Why is my body so much smaller \Nthan Miss Witch's body?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.85,0:15:27.70,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,It's almost like I'm a child and she's \Nan adult. We're not a good match at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.30,0:15:34.70,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,But I get the feeling that my body \Nwasn't supposed to be like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.31,0:15:39.70,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,A feeling that I was supposed to be\N a protector, not the one being protected.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.47,0:15:44.93,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I need to be focused on my \Nmagic training right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.93,0:15:47.38,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,but I feel overwhelmed \Nby things I can't control,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.38,0:15:49.88,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,and get distracted by irrational thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.78,0:15:54.79,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I have trouble spelling this \Nconfusion out in my diary.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.26,0:15:57.09,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Or maybe I don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.70,0:16:01.09,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I don't want to explain it all away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.44,0:16:08.98,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Yeah, he doesn't have a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.53,0:16:10.37,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.99,0:16:14.13,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,After all that training in black magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.13,0:16:17.19,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,he's probably got one-tenth of \Nthe abilities he should have by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.37,0:16:19.74,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,That little?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.74,0:16:22.00,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,You must have figured it out by now, Luna.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.60,0:16:25.72,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,He's definitely descended \Nfrom white witches.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.71,0:16:32.04,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,And it sounds like they've got their \Nown way to awaken their powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.73,0:16:35.98,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,He's gonna have to figure \Nout what that is by himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.26,0:16:42.02,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,But for us black witches, that's \Nsomething we'd probably want to avoid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.02,0:16:48.52,Italics,Green Spirit 1,0,0,0,,Good try, even though \Nyou've got it all wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.75,0:16:53.78,Italics,Green Spirit 2,0,0,0,,You should just give up. \NIt's such a waste of nice hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.66,0:16:55.78,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.78,0:16:58.51,Default,Green Spirit 1,0,0,0,,Can you hear us?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.51,0:17:00.79,Default,Green Spirit 2,0,0,0,,His magical powers are starting to grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.08,0:17:03.95,Default,Green Spirit 1,0,0,0,,We're right over here. Look down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.95,0:17:06.25,Default,Green Spirit 2,0,0,0,,No, we're behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.05,0:17:14.01,Default,Green Spirit 3,0,0,0,,He finally noticed us!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.01,0:17:15.94,Default,Green Spirit 1,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you, Lize.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.94,0:17:18.10,Default,Green Spirit 2,0,0,0,,Welcome to the spirit world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.03,0:17:20.49,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Spirit?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.49,0:17:22.31,Default,Green Spirit 3,0,0,0,,Look at how surprised he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.62,0:17:26.27,Default,Green Spirit 1,0,0,0,,Well gosh, you didn't \Nnotice us all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.27,0:17:28.76,Default,Green Spirit 2,0,0,0,,He still looks adorable \Nwhen confused, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.76,0:17:33.01,Default,Bean Spirit 1,0,0,0,,Good afternoon, Lize. \NI'm the bean spirit you created.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.01,0:17:34.66,Default,Bean Spirit 1,0,0,0,,I'll tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.58,0:17:41.05,Default,Bean Spirit 1,0,0,0,,Even if you do what the black witches \Nwant, you'll never become like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.05,0:17:41.74,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.74,0:17:43.76,Default,Thistle Spirit,0,0,0,,I am a thistle spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.76,0:17:47.18,Default,Thistle Spirit,0,0,0,,Lize, thank you for taking \Nsuch good care of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.18,0:17:51.71,Default,Thistle Spirit,0,0,0,,People of white witch lineage have a \Ndifferent constitution than black witches.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.71,0:17:52.82,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Constitution?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.82,0:17:56.14,Default,Water Spirit 1,0,0,0,,This child's seeds are more \Nmagical than they should be
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.14,0:17:58.59,Default,Water Spirit 1,0,0,0,,and it's got the green \Nspirits all in a tizzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.59,0:18:02.60,Default,Green Spirit 1,0,0,0,,Oh be quiet, water spirit. \NDon't be so annoying all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.60,0:18:04.23,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,What is happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.67,0:18:12.39,Default,Wind Spirit,0,0,0,,Hello, Lize. I'm a wind spirit. \NYou don't understand any of this, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.11,0:18:15.43,Default,Wind Spirit,0,0,0,,White witches are essentially "charms."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.43,0:18:19.37,Default,Wind Spirit,0,0,0,,In other words, your charm allows you \Nto borrow power from demons and spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.37,0:18:20.52,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Charm?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.91,0:18:24.65,Default,Wind Spirit,0,0,0,,White witches' magic and longevity \Nlargely draw from those energies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.00,0:18:28.54,Default,Green Spirit 1,0,0,0,,See? So the black witches and \Nwhite witches are totally different.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.65,0:18:32.01,Default,Green Spirit 2,0,0,0,,White witches' powers may seem trivial,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.01,0:18:36.58,Default,Green Spirit 2,0,0,0,,but their charm power is actually \Na weak point for the black witches.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.58,0:18:41.82,Default,Green Spirit 1,0,0,0,,Oh dear. Kinopio is upset. \NPerhaps we said too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.39,0:18:47.75,Default,Green Spirit 1,0,0,0,,So Lize, you should polish \Nyour charm abilities
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.75,0:18:50.41,Default,Green Spirit 1,0,0,0,,and use that power to entertain us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.41,0:18:55.39,Default,Green Spirit 1,0,0,0,,If you do, then we can help you out. \NThat's how white witch powers work.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.14,0:18:59.90,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,But I still don't know \Nwhat this is all about.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.32,0:19:03.55,Default,Green Spirit 1,0,0,0,,Yes, but you're already starting to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.55,0:19:05.43,Default,Green Spirit 2,0,0,0,,Sing us a song, Lize.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.43,0:19:09.90,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,A song? I've never sung before. \NI can't even think of one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.15,0:19:16.70,Default,Green Spirit 3,0,0,0,,You can do it. Just take your feelings \Nand put them to any melody you imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.13,0:19:19.85,Default,Green Spirit 2,0,0,0,,This is your white witch training.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.85,0:19:21.36,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Training?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.36,0:19:23.14,Default,Green Spirit 1,0,0,0,,Go for it, Lize.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.17,0:19:57.89,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,What the hell is that singing? Is it him?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.39,0:20:02.13,Default,Chatty Mushroom,0,0,0,,That is definitely spirit language.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.68,0:20:03.99,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Mushroom Lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.14,0:20:09.53,Default,Chatty Mushroom,0,0,0,,He probably carries the \Nlanguage inside his cells.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.18,0:20:14.42,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Do you understand what it \Nmeans, Luna and Claude?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.85,0:20:18.65,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,How would I know? I can \Nmore or less guess, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.67,0:20:21.65,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Do you understand, Mushroom Lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.65,0:20:24.16,Default,Chatty Mushroom,0,0,0,,Yes, I certainly do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.43,0:20:31.06,Flashback,Lize's Mother,0,0,0,,Lize, when you fall in love one day,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.93,0:20:37.17,Flashback,Lize's Mother,0,0,0,,song will become your solace, \Nyour strength, and your guide.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.67,0:20:41.67,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Whose voice is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.67,0:20:46.18,Flashback_Italics,Lize's Mother,0,0,0,,The power of love is what \Nawakens the white witch's charm
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.39,0:20:49.33,Flashback_Italics,Lize's Mother,0,0,0,,and amplifies it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.69,0:21:00.26,Default,Green Spirit 1,0,0,0,,Wonderful! You're great, Lize!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.26,0:21:03.00,Default,Green Spirit 2,0,0,0,,How cute! I can totally get behind that!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.00,0:21:07.81,Default,Green Spirit 1,0,0,0,,Lize, I offer you the \Nblessing of the trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.20,0:21:15.56,Default,Water Spirit 1,0,0,0,,And we present you with \Nthe protection of water.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.43,0:21:19.74,Default,Bean Spirit,0,0,0,,We give you the seeds of wishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.11,0:21:27.29,Default,Green Spirit 1,0,0,0,,Do you get it now, Lize?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.97,0:21:31.03,Default,Green Spirit 1,0,0,0,,Polishing your charm \Nwith the power of love
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.03,0:21:33.47,Default,Green Spirit 1,0,0,0,,is the key to white witch magic training.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.47,0:21:36.49,Default,Thistle Spirit,0,0,0,,There are a lot of different \Nkinds of white witches,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.49,0:21:39.09,Default,Thistle Spirit,0,0,0,,but your singing is especially lovely!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.48,0:21:42.49,Default,Green Spirit 3,0,0,0,,Love may be poison for black witches,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.49,0:21:44.84,Default,Green Spirit 3,0,0,0,,but it is a source of \Npower for white witches.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.15,0:21:46.49,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,What? Poison?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.49,0:21:51.99,Default,Green Spirit 1,0,0,0,,Sing once again, Lize. Sing so \Nthat even the sky blesses you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.21,0:21:54.00,Default,Water Spirit 1,0,0,0,,So that even rainbows appear!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.52,0:22:00.23,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,In that moment, I still \Ndidn't understand anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.22,0:22:04.01,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Looks like that gut feeling \NI had was spot on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.01,0:22:05.56,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,It makes me sick,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.01,0:22:09.62,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,but if it gets the job done, I'm not \Ngonna complain about how he does it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.18,0:22:14.24,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,As long as it doesn't put her in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.24,0:22:17.54,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,I had no idea that this feeling \Nthat awakened my magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.87,0:22:20.33,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,this once-in-a-lifetime love,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.18,0:22:29.46,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,would drive you into a corner, Luna.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.37,0:22:41.50,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,TRANSLATION: MICHAEL ARNOLD
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.79,0:22:46.17,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,SUBTITLE TIMING: ANDY ELLIS\NEDITING: ELISABETH CRIST
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.76,0:22:52.14,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,QUALITY CHECK: GABRIELLA ALABANZA\NTRANSLATION CHECK: MICHELLE TYMON
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.65,0:24:10.25,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,NEXT TIME: \NTHE HOUSE IN THE BLACK FOREST
